WEBVTT

00:01:29.244 --> 00:01:31.586
Whether you're navigating
changing job conditions

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:33.029
brought on by automation,

00:01:33.053 --> 00:01:36.205
shifting geopolitics
in a more globalized world,

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:39.619
or simply changing family dynamics
and personal relationships.

00:01:39.934 --> 00:01:42.537
Each of us, as individuals, groups,

00:01:42.561 --> 00:01:44.807
corporations and even governments

00:01:44.831 --> 00:01:47.212
are being forced to grapple
with more change

00:01:47.236 --> 00:01:49.503
than ever before in human history.

00:01:50.014 --> 00:01:52.547
So, how do we assess our adaptability?

00:01:53.419 --> 00:01:56.043
I use three tricks
when meeting with founders.

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:57.456
Here's the first.

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:00.154
Think back to your
most recent job interview.